WEBVTT

01:36.590 --> 01:41.030
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.370 --> 01:43.870
[Episode 11]

02:13.630 --> 02:14.310
Miss Qing,

02:14.680 --> 02:16.360
we've searched Xiao Qiushui thoroughly

02:16.360 --> 02:17.890
and found nothing unusual.

02:20.590 --> 02:21.590
[The Power Gang has never]

02:21.590 --> 02:23.190
[replied to Song until now,]

02:23.430 --> 02:24.960
[just to trap Xiao Qiushui]

02:25.079 --> 02:27.140
[and obtain the Hero Command Token.]

02:28.360 --> 02:29.750
[I'll definitely make him]

02:29.750 --> 02:32.079
[reveal where the Hero Command Token is.]

02:49.240 --> 02:50.000
Who are you?

02:50.630 --> 02:52.090
Didn't Tang Fang tell you?

02:52.870 --> 02:54.150
I'm her close friend in the Tang Sect,

02:54.150 --> 02:56.550
and together we're known
as the beauty duo.

02:58.240 --> 03:00.360
She sent me to take good care of you.

03:14.630 --> 03:16.030
What did you make me take?

03:16.750 --> 03:18.950
Even a master of peerless martial arts,

03:19.680 --> 03:21.480
after taking that special pill,

03:22.430 --> 03:24.000
has to do whatever I say.

03:41.030 --> 03:42.470
The Hero Command Token

03:44.590 --> 03:46.590
and all your secrets—

03:48.520 --> 03:50.000
tell me everything.

04:01.470 --> 04:02.280
Who are you?

04:06.000 --> 04:07.000
Xiao Qiushui…

04:09.280 --> 04:11.080
Xiao Qiushui from Huanhua Sect.

04:18.560 --> 04:19.959
Between Tang Fang and me,

04:20.390 --> 04:21.649
who is more beautiful?

04:27.240 --> 04:27.870
You…

04:33.390 --> 04:34.990
You're a bit uglier than her.

04:35.480 --> 04:36.120
What?

04:38.120 --> 04:41.750
Your hand is rotting
from using too much poison.

04:43.750 --> 04:44.610
-You...
-Qing!

04:48.430 --> 04:49.040
Stop.

04:55.310 --> 04:57.640
Did he say
where the Hero Command Token is?

04:58.950 --> 05:00.430
Xiao Qiushui, tell me,

05:01.070 --> 05:03.070
where is the Hero Command Token now?

05:07.360 --> 05:08.680
In the Tang Sect.

05:10.870 --> 05:12.800
Song, that's impossible.

05:13.390 --> 05:15.450
I've searched both him and Tang Fang.

05:16.160 --> 05:17.620
They don't have the token.

05:20.190 --> 05:21.000
Xiao Qiushui.

05:22.830 --> 05:23.630
Xiao Qiushui!

05:26.160 --> 05:26.750
Tell me,

05:27.430 --> 05:30.630
where in the Tang Sect
did you hide the Hero Command Token?

05:32.270 --> 05:34.190
Didn't I just tell you?

05:36.159 --> 05:37.560
The Hero Command Token

05:39.430 --> 05:41.480
is buried in the Tang Sect.

05:43.750 --> 05:46.270
I only remember it's in the bamboo grove.

05:49.720 --> 05:51.780
Looks like this brat had a backup plan

05:52.159 --> 05:53.890
before entering the Tang Sect.

05:54.480 --> 05:55.010
Let's go.

06:05.190 --> 06:06.190
Two idiots.

06:08.800 --> 06:10.330
Good thing I came prepared.

06:13.190 --> 06:13.870
Miss Tang.

06:16.480 --> 06:19.190
If I accidentally take
the Tang Sect's poison,

06:19.630 --> 06:21.190
is there a cure?

06:23.270 --> 06:25.000
It's not that I don't trust you.

06:29.950 --> 06:31.150
Here is the antidote.

06:31.270 --> 06:33.070
It's a treasure of the Tang Sect.

06:33.320 --> 06:34.790
It's a cure for most poisons.

06:34.790 --> 06:37.600
But it only lasts for 4 hours.

06:38.680 --> 06:40.360
[Tang Fang never mentioned]

06:40.830 --> 06:43.510
[there were such despicable people
in the Tang Sect.]

06:43.510 --> 06:45.240
[I wonder how she's doing now.]

06:48.070 --> 06:48.720
Miss!

06:49.830 --> 06:50.510
Miss,

06:51.190 --> 06:52.120
are you alright?

07:11.270 --> 07:12.750
He said it was half a mile away.

07:12.750 --> 07:15.070
We've dug around
almost every tree in this area

07:15.070 --> 07:17.000
and still haven't found the token.

07:18.310 --> 07:20.240
Could that Xiao boy have lied to me?

07:20.680 --> 07:21.430
Impossible.

07:22.430 --> 07:25.230
No one can resist
the effects of that special pill.

07:25.720 --> 07:26.980
He couldn't have lied.

07:49.159 --> 07:50.890
Xiao Qiushui, are you alright?

07:51.390 --> 07:52.070
I'm fine.

07:52.390 --> 07:54.790
Thankfully,
I had the antidote you gave me.

07:55.600 --> 07:56.680
Let's get out of here.

07:56.680 --> 07:57.480
Xiao Qiushui!

08:00.510 --> 08:02.680
Xiao Qiushui, how dare you lie to us?

08:03.920 --> 08:04.600
I didn't.

08:05.950 --> 08:07.210
Did you find anything?

08:08.390 --> 08:09.120
Fang,

08:09.360 --> 08:10.870
you don't have to die

08:10.870 --> 08:11.930
with this Xiao boy.

08:12.560 --> 08:13.480
Beg me now.

08:14.160 --> 08:16.950
If you beg me,
I'll always soften toward you.

08:18.310 --> 08:18.920
Song!

08:20.190 --> 08:22.120
Is there something wrong with him?

08:22.750 --> 08:24.480
Young Master Xiao, if we've offended you,

08:24.480 --> 08:25.540
please forgive us.

08:25.950 --> 08:28.190
Actually, now that you have
the Hero Command Token,

08:28.190 --> 08:29.800
what danger can really threaten you?

08:29.800 --> 08:32.150
I can introduce you to my grandmother.

08:32.510 --> 08:34.200
With her experience in the martial world,

08:34.200 --> 08:36.750
she can help you
use the Hero Command Token wisely,

08:36.750 --> 08:40.409
lift the siege on the Xiao family,
and ruin the villains' schemes.

08:46.200 --> 08:47.630
Let me tell you the truth.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.650
The Hero Command Token

08:50.670 --> 08:52.930
has already been taken by the Power Gang.

08:56.240 --> 08:59.120
Young Master Xiao,
you're still not being honest.

08:59.240 --> 09:00.910
How do you know I'm lying?

09:01.670 --> 09:02.470
Let me ask you.

09:02.910 --> 09:04.370
Did the Power Gang tell you

09:04.790 --> 09:06.720
they never got the token?

09:07.030 --> 09:09.690
Do you really have dealings
with the Power Gang?

09:10.720 --> 09:13.510
Fang, who are you to question me?

09:13.790 --> 09:14.630
You went to the Xiao Residence

09:14.630 --> 09:16.560
just to get the Hero Command Token.

09:16.960 --> 09:18.020
Young Master Xiao,

09:18.200 --> 09:21.030
that's the only reason
she went to the Xiao Residence.

09:21.030 --> 09:22.830
You've noticed it, haven't you?

09:26.720 --> 09:27.600
And, Fang,

09:27.960 --> 09:29.910
I've already reported
that you brought an outsider

09:29.910 --> 09:30.970
into the Tang Sect.

09:31.150 --> 09:32.870
Why hasn't your father come to see you?

09:32.870 --> 09:35.150
Could the rumors be true—
that he's gravely injured

09:35.150 --> 09:36.410
and hasn't recovered?

09:39.000 --> 09:41.630
If so, your branch of the family
will hardly hold out.

09:41.630 --> 09:43.030
You should beg me nicely

09:43.510 --> 09:44.510
to marry you.

09:46.790 --> 09:49.850
Then I'll spare
your branch of the family in the future.

09:51.870 --> 09:54.630
My father's internal energy
is on the verge of a breakthrough.

09:54.630 --> 09:55.750
He's cultivating in seclusion.

09:55.750 --> 09:57.270
What's so strange about that?

09:57.270 --> 09:58.400
If you have the guts,

09:58.750 --> 10:01.030
go force your way
into the sect leader's quarters!

10:01.030 --> 10:02.030
Let's see

10:02.720 --> 10:05.180
if my father would let you leave
in one piece.

10:05.510 --> 10:06.960
If you don't have the guts,

10:06.960 --> 10:08.600
shut up and get out of my way!

10:09.390 --> 10:09.840
You…

10:12.240 --> 10:13.200
Sorry to interrupt,

10:13.200 --> 10:14.440
but is the Tang Sect

10:14.840 --> 10:17.840
always so full of schemes

10:18.000 --> 10:19.240
and infighting?

10:20.870 --> 10:21.670
Yes, it is.

10:23.240 --> 10:25.040
How else would one survive here?

10:25.910 --> 10:26.720
Wait!

10:32.390 --> 10:34.250
Since we've come to the Tang Sect,

10:34.390 --> 10:36.390
let's follow the Tang Sect's rules.

10:39.200 --> 10:40.130
Look behind you!

10:43.360 --> 10:43.960
Run!

11:05.720 --> 11:06.440
That way.

11:06.790 --> 11:07.590
Xiao Qiushui.

11:10.510 --> 11:11.750
What's wrong, Tang Fang?

11:11.750 --> 11:12.440
I'm sorry.

11:13.080 --> 11:14.720
Since we were in the Sword Manor,

11:14.720 --> 11:16.910
I've been plotting to stay close to you,

11:16.910 --> 11:18.910
just to find the "Voidheart Codex."

11:19.120 --> 11:20.510
But you trusted me so much

11:20.510 --> 11:21.840
and treated me as a friend.

11:21.840 --> 11:23.500
I brought you to the Tang Sect,

11:23.510 --> 11:26.510
hoping I'd help you save the Xiao family
so I could ask you

11:26.510 --> 11:27.510
to repay my favor.

11:27.910 --> 11:30.240
It was all just
for my own selfish desires.

11:37.200 --> 11:37.800
Tang Fang,

11:39.720 --> 11:42.150
I don't know
where the "Voidheart Codex" is.

11:42.150 --> 11:43.510
But if we find Crazy Yan,

11:43.840 --> 11:44.550
maybe we can learn

11:44.550 --> 11:45.870
its whereabouts.

11:46.240 --> 11:47.570
After saving my family,

11:47.960 --> 11:48.910
if one day

11:50.200 --> 11:52.000
I do find the "Voidheart Codex,"

11:52.320 --> 11:53.720
I'll tell you where it is.

11:55.790 --> 11:56.440
Thank you.

11:57.550 --> 11:58.240
Over there!

12:03.120 --> 12:03.650
Let's go!

12:09.670 --> 12:10.800
No time to hesitate.

12:11.120 --> 12:11.600
Jump!

12:19.630 --> 12:20.440
Move aside!

12:22.790 --> 12:24.250
Careful! You overshot it.

12:43.960 --> 12:45.090
Your sleeve is torn.

12:46.000 --> 12:46.630
It's torn.

12:48.510 --> 12:50.440
All of you stay inside! Don't look!

13:00.150 --> 13:01.480
You want to fight again?

13:05.390 --> 13:06.320
I once made a vow—

13:06.550 --> 13:08.270
if any man saw my body,

13:09.080 --> 13:10.390
I'd kill him.

13:10.790 --> 13:11.790
And of all people…

13:16.910 --> 13:18.710
That's quite a rash vow you made.

13:19.150 --> 13:20.840
If I hadn't pulled you just now,

13:20.840 --> 13:22.700
you'd have fallen into the river.

13:25.510 --> 13:27.750
Before my father became
the head of the family,

13:27.750 --> 13:30.240
scoundrels from other factions
always bullied us.

13:30.240 --> 13:32.510
One day, while I was bathing,

13:33.150 --> 13:34.880
they barged in and harassed me.

13:35.080 --> 13:36.540
My mother killed them all.

13:38.910 --> 13:40.000
That day,

13:40.720 --> 13:41.600
I made a vow—

13:42.390 --> 13:43.630
I'd train hard,

13:44.450 --> 13:46.240
and if any man saw my body again,

13:46.510 --> 13:47.640
I'd have to kill him.

13:50.080 --> 13:52.630
You should consider the circumstances
with such a deadly vow.

13:52.630 --> 13:55.150
If it's a wicked man doing it on purpose,
you should kill him,

13:55.150 --> 13:56.670
but I just saved you.

14:01.840 --> 14:02.700
My mother said,

14:03.320 --> 14:04.720
unless the man is my husband,

14:04.720 --> 14:06.120
there are no exceptions.

14:14.750 --> 14:15.810
Are you kidding me?

14:17.440 --> 14:19.170
Anyway, that's the vow I swore.

14:19.480 --> 14:20.610
Don't overthink it.

14:23.150 --> 14:24.810
Then let me ask you something.

14:24.840 --> 14:26.300
This vow you made as a child

14:26.790 --> 14:28.630
actually has many loopholes.

14:29.030 --> 14:31.560
If someone accidentally
glanced at your body

14:31.840 --> 14:33.370
without seeing it clearly,

14:33.480 --> 14:35.840
would you have to kill him too?

14:36.390 --> 14:38.360
Who knows if he meant it or not?

14:39.150 --> 14:41.270
I made this vow in my late mother's name.

14:41.270 --> 14:42.400
I'll never break it.

14:45.720 --> 14:48.050
You're insane. What kind of logic is that?

14:48.550 --> 14:50.280
I'm not going to argue with you.

14:50.840 --> 14:51.550
Then tell me this:

14:51.550 --> 14:52.720
don't you consider me a friend?

14:52.720 --> 14:54.120
You'd even kill a friend?

14:54.600 --> 14:55.660
I already told you,

14:56.150 --> 14:57.360
no exceptions.

15:09.960 --> 15:11.620
I don't want to fight with you.

15:12.080 --> 15:13.480
You'd better step aside.

15:14.080 --> 15:14.670
No way.

15:25.240 --> 15:26.360
Excuse me, you two.

15:27.030 --> 15:29.000
I've been listening to you for a while

15:29.000 --> 15:30.460
and can't take it anymore.

15:31.630 --> 15:33.320
You don't want to die, do you?

15:36.390 --> 15:38.360
You don't want to kill him, do you?

15:41.080 --> 15:42.810
Isn't there another solution?

15:43.120 --> 15:44.580
You just need to marry her.

15:46.200 --> 15:46.750
Miss,

15:47.120 --> 15:47.960
I can see

15:47.960 --> 15:49.600
you can't bring yourself to do it.

15:49.600 --> 15:51.030
But you can't stay on my boat

15:51.030 --> 15:52.030
forever, can you?

15:57.120 --> 15:58.150
M-Me? Marry her?

16:02.360 --> 16:03.240
She's right.

16:03.510 --> 16:05.770
If you want to live, there's only one way.

16:06.510 --> 16:07.150
Marry me.

16:07.750 --> 16:09.320
Stop fooling around.

16:09.320 --> 16:10.980
Marriage isn't child's play.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.480
How can you just ask me

16:12.480 --> 16:13.480
to marry you?

16:13.870 --> 16:15.400
I can't break my vow anyway.

16:15.670 --> 16:17.330
I still have many things to do.

16:18.000 --> 16:20.150
I can't kill you for now.

16:21.360 --> 16:22.440
But as it happens,

16:23.550 --> 16:24.440
I need someone to help me

16:24.440 --> 16:27.080
break into the Snare Formation
of the Tang Sect.

16:27.080 --> 16:29.510
Only then can I get Tang Song off my back.

16:30.440 --> 16:31.970
Otherwise, I'll have to...

16:38.670 --> 16:40.360
I can help you with that.

16:41.240 --> 16:42.360
But you're right.

16:44.750 --> 16:45.910
I gave Rou my word.

16:48.910 --> 16:52.150
Is the Snare Formation difficult
to break through?

16:56.630 --> 16:58.550
It's basically a death trap.

16:59.360 --> 17:00.890
If you can make it out alive,

17:00.960 --> 17:03.910
we'll hold a wedding ceremony.

17:04.440 --> 17:06.369
Afterward, I'll just divorce you.

17:08.680 --> 17:10.810
Just don't make decisions on your own.

17:10.829 --> 17:11.890
It's settled then.

17:15.069 --> 17:16.589
Sorry for holding up
your wedding procession.

17:16.589 --> 17:19.450
This money is both compensation
and a wedding gift.

17:19.790 --> 17:21.720
Congratulations on your wedding.

17:29.000 --> 17:31.510
I wish you a long and happy marriage.

17:31.510 --> 17:33.640
May you be blessed with children soon!

17:35.640 --> 17:38.000
Stop looking.
It has nothing to do with you.

17:38.000 --> 17:39.660
We need to hurry to Guangling.

17:39.680 --> 17:40.640
How are you going?

17:40.640 --> 17:41.570
Do you have a map?

17:58.030 --> 17:59.030
A map of Jinzhong?

18:09.400 --> 18:11.880
These red dots must be
the hidden lookout posts.

18:11.880 --> 18:13.340
I went to Tang Song's place

18:13.440 --> 18:15.240
to see you but couldn't find you.

18:15.550 --> 18:17.510
I saw him locking this in a drawer.

18:18.640 --> 18:19.640
He said

18:19.960 --> 18:22.440
he spent a lot of effort and time

18:22.830 --> 18:24.440
marking all the strongholds

18:24.680 --> 18:25.680
of the Power Gang.

18:27.070 --> 18:28.870
I guess these sects marked in red

18:30.440 --> 18:33.170
have all aligned themselves
with the Power Gang.

18:33.550 --> 18:35.590
Look, these strongholds

18:35.960 --> 18:38.160
are all on the main routes to Guangling.

18:38.640 --> 18:41.640
I can't believe
the Wuhupeng Sect, the Tanglang Sect,

18:42.440 --> 18:43.370
and the Wuyi Gang

18:43.640 --> 18:45.700
have all submitted to the Power Gang.

18:47.030 --> 18:48.680
With these sects in the way,

18:49.350 --> 18:52.310
Yiren's reinforcements
from Guangling to the Sword Manor

18:52.310 --> 18:53.590
will be hindered.

18:54.350 --> 18:55.880
He'll have to take a detour.

18:56.350 --> 18:57.680
If that's not possible,

18:58.350 --> 18:59.610
we'll need to find a way

19:00.720 --> 19:02.180
to clear these obstacles.

19:03.830 --> 19:04.890
It's decided then.

19:05.030 --> 19:06.030
And don't forget—

19:06.400 --> 19:07.920
once the Sword Manor is safe,

19:07.920 --> 19:09.270
you must go challenge the formation,

19:09.270 --> 19:11.030
or I'll have to take your life.

19:14.030 --> 19:14.920
As for that,

19:15.720 --> 19:17.680
we need to think about it carefully.

19:17.680 --> 19:19.590
Don't overthink it.

19:20.920 --> 19:21.850
Let fate decide.

19:23.030 --> 19:23.560
Let's go.

19:29.160 --> 19:30.030
Spread the word

19:30.240 --> 19:32.000
that Xiao Qiushui and Tang Fang

19:32.000 --> 19:34.200
have taken
the Hero Command Token to Guangling.

19:34.200 --> 19:36.260
You want everyone to know about that?

19:40.350 --> 19:42.350
They think they can escape my grasp.

19:42.550 --> 19:43.750
It won't be that easy.

19:44.030 --> 19:45.480
Once the news spreads,

19:45.960 --> 19:49.220
people from the martial world
will go after Xiao Qiushui.

19:49.440 --> 19:52.000
I'd like to see how long he can last.

19:54.910 --> 19:56.260
[Xiao Residence]

20:01.720 --> 20:02.350
Kaiyan.

20:02.720 --> 20:03.440
Xueyu?

20:03.790 --> 20:04.790
You may leave now.

20:07.240 --> 20:09.030
Any messages
from the Sword Manor in Jindu?

20:09.030 --> 20:10.160
What did Father say?

20:10.200 --> 20:12.070
These are all messages from our men

20:12.070 --> 20:14.530
at the ferry stops
confirming their safety.

20:14.920 --> 20:17.030
Father hasn't replied.

20:17.550 --> 20:19.160
I'm afraid that as time passes,

20:19.160 --> 20:20.680
all the clues and evidence in the village

20:20.680 --> 20:21.680
will be wiped out.

20:22.070 --> 20:24.310
Let's go to that village again.

20:24.880 --> 20:26.680
We should examine everything carefully

20:26.680 --> 20:28.210
and preserve the evidence.

20:28.310 --> 20:28.840
Alright.

21:01.480 --> 21:03.610
These herbs are used for pill-making.

21:03.880 --> 21:05.240
Perhaps we can develop

21:05.640 --> 21:07.370
an antidote for the villagers.

21:20.180 --> 21:20.900
Xueyu!

21:35.720 --> 21:37.180
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

21:38.680 --> 21:39.940
Let's check on Kaiyan.

21:44.750 --> 21:45.440
Kaiyan.

21:45.500 --> 21:46.620
His internal energy
is temporarily blocked.

21:46.620 --> 21:47.880
It's nothing serious.

21:48.920 --> 21:49.520
Kaiyan.

21:49.540 --> 21:50.070
Kaiyan.

21:50.720 --> 21:51.580
What happened?

21:51.830 --> 21:52.480
Are you okay?

21:52.480 --> 21:53.270
What happened to me?

21:53.270 --> 21:54.800
If I hadn't arrived in time,

21:55.110 --> 21:56.510
you two would've been dead by now.

21:56.510 --> 21:58.000
How many times have I told you

21:58.000 --> 21:59.200
not to act on your own?

21:59.350 --> 22:00.720
That person in black just now

22:00.720 --> 22:02.540
must have come to destroy evidence.

22:02.540 --> 22:04.000
We couldn't just stand by.

22:05.030 --> 22:06.230
I've told you before—

22:06.240 --> 22:09.110
we must look at the bigger picture
and prioritize the Xiao family.

22:09.110 --> 22:11.440
Even if you find
the evidence now, so what?

22:11.960 --> 22:14.160
Will the Power Gang actually
reason with us?

22:14.160 --> 22:16.030
In the end, it'll just put

22:16.510 --> 22:19.440
the Xiao family in open conflict
with the Power Gang.

22:30.680 --> 22:31.310
Yiren.

22:33.790 --> 22:34.960
I just found this.

22:35.350 --> 22:36.880
This snake-needle grass

22:36.880 --> 22:39.210
looks very similar to the diamond flower.

22:39.240 --> 22:41.270
The villagers' poisoning and madness

22:41.270 --> 22:42.670
might be related to this.

22:42.750 --> 22:45.750
Yiren, Xueyu has a healer's compassion

22:46.200 --> 22:47.510
and is eager to save lives.

22:47.510 --> 22:49.040
But that was close just now.

22:49.550 --> 22:51.400
That man's internal energy
was overwhelming.

22:51.400 --> 22:52.880
He almost killed the two of us.

22:52.880 --> 22:55.400
We should just wait for Father's message

22:56.160 --> 22:57.820
and follow his instructions.

22:58.960 --> 23:00.200
I know you mean well,

23:00.510 --> 23:02.070
but from now on,
whenever you make decisions

23:02.070 --> 23:03.330
or something happens,

23:03.590 --> 23:04.690
talk with me first.

23:05.160 --> 23:06.960
I'm not just your elder brother.

23:07.440 --> 23:10.040
I'm also the acting leader
of the Huanhua Sect.

23:13.200 --> 23:14.680
Your strategy actually

23:15.700 --> 23:17.760
eliminated 2 Power Gang strongholds

23:17.980 --> 23:19.380
and cleared a path for us.

23:20.880 --> 23:24.750
The reinforcements
can go to Jinzhong without hindrance now.

23:27.590 --> 23:30.550
Judging by when Old Madam Wu
sent the message,

23:31.200 --> 23:32.200
Yiren should have

23:32.920 --> 23:35.380
returned to Jinzhong
from Guangling by now.

23:35.640 --> 23:37.270
Unfortunately, on our way here,

23:37.270 --> 23:39.000
we haven't seen any sign of him.

23:39.440 --> 23:41.510
I'm afraid
something might have gone wrong.

23:41.510 --> 23:42.310
Let's do this.

23:43.160 --> 23:44.690
We'll go buy a fast horse now

23:45.160 --> 23:47.490
and head straight for Guangling to check.

23:52.920 --> 23:54.720
These are all mules and donkeys.

23:54.750 --> 23:55.750
They're not fast.

23:57.250 --> 23:58.580
Sir, what do you want?

23:59.000 --> 24:00.310
A donkey or a horse?

24:03.550 --> 24:05.350
There's a good horse over there.

24:06.510 --> 24:07.640
You have a good eye, sir.

24:07.640 --> 24:09.030
That's a great horse that can run

24:09.030 --> 24:09.880
incredibly far in a day.

24:09.880 --> 24:11.440
But it's a bit expensive.

24:17.590 --> 24:19.590
How did you get such a fine horse?

24:21.510 --> 24:22.880
I bought it, of course.

24:24.070 --> 24:26.600
There's still a military seal
on the stirrup.

24:29.480 --> 24:30.480
Tell me the truth.

24:31.000 --> 24:32.730
Where did that horse come from?

24:37.070 --> 24:39.130
It's fine if you don't want to tell us.

24:39.550 --> 24:41.950
We'll have to
report it to the authorities.

24:42.680 --> 24:44.280
I'll tell you. I'll tell you.

25:03.720 --> 25:04.980
That horse dealer said

25:05.270 --> 25:07.070
he was passing by here yesterday

25:07.750 --> 25:09.810
and saw this soldier lying dead here.

25:10.720 --> 25:12.320
That's why he took the horse.

25:45.550 --> 25:46.310
Sorry.

26:51.960 --> 26:53.550
This is the messenger sent by Old Madam Wu

26:53.550 --> 26:55.550
to Guangling to ask Yiren for help.

26:57.070 --> 26:58.270
With such a blockade,

26:59.110 --> 27:00.240
Yiren and the others

27:01.830 --> 27:02.880
probably have no idea

27:02.880 --> 27:04.540
about our current situation.

27:06.400 --> 27:10.030
So I need to hurry back
to meet up with Yiren.

27:14.350 --> 27:15.550
The checkpoint ahead

27:16.070 --> 27:18.200
is where Chuanjin and Guangling meet.

27:18.590 --> 27:21.720
Looks like it's already
under the Power Gang's control.

27:21.750 --> 27:24.480
The terrain here makes this place
hard to breach.

27:26.720 --> 27:28.650
There's another ferry stop ahead.

27:29.270 --> 27:31.530
It's not under the Power Gang's control.

27:31.680 --> 27:32.880
Let's go there first.

27:33.830 --> 27:37.090
The rain is heavy this season,
and the river has risen a lot.

27:38.000 --> 27:39.600
It may be hard to find a ferry.

27:39.880 --> 27:42.010
We still have to figure something out.

28:10.490 --> 28:14.110
[Here lies a brave
and loyal soldier of the Wu Army]

28:20.920 --> 28:22.480
Tang Song is so useless.

28:23.030 --> 28:24.440
Xiao Qiushui had entered the Tang Sect,

28:24.440 --> 28:26.170
but he still couldn't keep him.

28:26.720 --> 28:28.160
Tang Song is spreading rumors

28:28.160 --> 28:30.690
that Xiao Qiushui
has the Hero Command Token.

28:30.790 --> 28:31.550
I'm afraid

28:31.550 --> 28:32.830
many people are already planning

28:32.830 --> 28:34.230
to go after Xiao Qiushui.

28:36.200 --> 28:36.790
Master, should I

28:36.790 --> 28:39.050
go kill this good-for-nothing Tang Song

28:39.240 --> 28:39.880
for you?

28:40.440 --> 28:43.100
There's something more important
for you to do.

28:43.310 --> 28:46.110
Before Xiao Qiushui
parted ways with Old Madam Wu,

28:46.480 --> 28:48.080
she dismissed everyone else

28:48.350 --> 28:49.750
and spoke with him alone.

28:50.350 --> 28:51.200
So the Hero Command Token

28:51.200 --> 28:53.060
is very likely in his possession.

28:53.160 --> 28:54.090
Starting today,

28:55.270 --> 28:57.880
whoever brings Xiao Qiushui
to the Power Gang

28:58.550 --> 29:00.200
will be rewarded with the Wind Token.

29:00.200 --> 29:02.400
But the Wind Token is your personal token.

29:02.400 --> 29:04.720
It allows its holder
to make a request of you.

29:04.720 --> 29:05.750
Chief once said

29:06.310 --> 29:08.680
this token would give people
leverage over you.

29:08.680 --> 29:10.110
He forbade you from using it again.

29:10.110 --> 29:10.840
Don't worry.

29:11.550 --> 29:13.110
At worst, I'll just kill the holder

29:13.110 --> 29:14.770
before they make any request.

29:19.400 --> 29:22.000
Xiao Qiushui failed
to get help in Jinzhong,

29:22.310 --> 29:24.440
so he must be rushing to Guangling now.

29:25.510 --> 29:26.970
Go after him immediately.

29:27.000 --> 29:27.640
Yes.

29:29.270 --> 29:29.880
Tang Fang…

29:31.640 --> 29:33.370
Is she still with Xiao Qiushui?

29:33.470 --> 29:34.230
Yes.

30:05.720 --> 30:06.590
Feng.

30:12.960 --> 30:15.350
I stole some rice cakes
from the kitchen for you.

30:15.350 --> 30:16.150
Hurry and eat.

30:16.550 --> 30:18.000
Don't let them find out.

30:36.750 --> 30:39.210
[Guangling is the Sword King's territory.]

30:39.590 --> 30:41.450
[Tang Fang is also in Guangling.]

30:43.510 --> 30:44.200
Fang.

30:51.720 --> 30:52.310
Sir.

30:53.510 --> 30:55.910
Take care.
Come back for more if you like it.

30:57.550 --> 30:58.750
Here. Eat something.

30:59.640 --> 31:01.590
This situation is urgent,
and time is tight.

31:01.590 --> 31:03.510
Go check if there are any inns nearby.

31:03.510 --> 31:04.440
I'll look over there

31:04.440 --> 31:05.680
for other boatmen

31:05.830 --> 31:09.290
and see if I can book a boat
that leaves early tomorrow morning.

31:09.590 --> 31:10.510
Be careful.

31:30.790 --> 31:32.350
[Father, Mother.]

31:32.960 --> 31:34.290
[Are you both alright?]

31:35.720 --> 31:36.720
[Wait for me.]

31:37.590 --> 31:39.450
[I'll hurry back as soon as I can.]

31:46.270 --> 31:46.790
Sir.

31:47.680 --> 31:48.680
Are there any other

31:48.680 --> 31:50.680
ferry stops or boatmen around here?

31:50.910 --> 31:51.480
No.

31:53.070 --> 31:53.680
Thanks.

31:55.920 --> 31:56.570
Sir.

31:57.640 --> 31:59.500
I heard you're looking for an inn.

31:59.750 --> 32:01.480
There's an inn called Ferry Inn nearby.

32:01.480 --> 32:03.540
There are two guys there up to no good.

32:03.720 --> 32:05.750
I'm afraid your friend might get tricked.

32:05.750 --> 32:06.480
Be careful.

32:13.270 --> 32:16.150
[Ferry Inn]

32:21.070 --> 32:21.880
Anyone here?

32:23.490 --> 32:26.010
[Tie Xingyue, the Fart King]

32:24.310 --> 32:26.720
Hello? Is the owner here?

32:27.830 --> 32:28.670
Yes, yes.

32:29.790 --> 32:32.000
Are you alone, sir?

32:29.840 --> 32:31.610
[Qiu Nangu, Iron Mouth]

32:32.880 --> 32:33.880
You're the owner?

32:34.110 --> 32:35.510
Yes, I'm the owner.

32:36.160 --> 32:38.420
Is this inn converted from a cattle shed?

32:38.550 --> 32:40.510
It's dirty and stinks of cow dung.

32:40.790 --> 32:41.990
Can anyone stay here?

32:42.000 --> 32:43.030
Sir, sir,

32:44.880 --> 32:46.750
I rarely get customers,

32:46.750 --> 32:48.200
so I don't clean often.

32:48.510 --> 32:49.480
My apologies.

32:49.480 --> 32:50.830
I'll clean it up for you right away.

32:50.830 --> 32:52.560
Don't bother. I'm not staying.

32:55.350 --> 32:56.680
Now that you've come in,

32:56.720 --> 32:58.880
you can't leave so easily.

32:58.880 --> 32:59.510
You…

33:11.480 --> 33:13.790
Tie, that was some convincing acting!

33:14.200 --> 33:15.000
Of course.

33:16.550 --> 33:18.080
That girl from the Tang Sect

33:18.110 --> 33:19.770
has powerful hidden weapons,

33:20.000 --> 33:21.350
but they're no match
for your knockout powder.

33:21.350 --> 33:22.810
She passed out instantly.

33:22.830 --> 33:25.000
There's no one I can't knock out.

33:28.030 --> 33:29.290
But speaking of which,

33:29.680 --> 33:30.640
wasn't Xiao Qiushui

33:30.640 --> 33:32.700
supposed to come with this Tang girl?

33:32.880 --> 33:34.340
Why hasn't he shown up yet?

33:36.640 --> 33:37.550
Don't worry.

33:38.750 --> 33:39.720
Xiao Qiushui

33:40.160 --> 33:42.590
will definitely come
to save this Tang girl.

33:42.590 --> 33:44.190
We'll just wait here for him.

33:44.480 --> 33:46.350
Exactly. Let's wait for him

33:47.000 --> 33:48.530
to walk right into our trap.

33:56.880 --> 33:58.960
Speak of the devil.

33:59.400 --> 33:59.950
Let's go.

33:59.970 --> 34:00.660
Hurry!

35:04.630 --> 35:06.230
Quick! Give me the antidote.

35:07.190 --> 35:08.260
The antidote! Now.

35:09.920 --> 35:10.760
Here.

35:20.590 --> 35:21.110
Tell me,

35:22.110 --> 35:23.170
who are you people?

35:26.030 --> 35:28.400
I'm Tie Xingyue, the Fart King.

35:30.190 --> 35:31.650
I'm Qiu Nangu, Iron Mouth.

35:31.920 --> 35:33.380
You've heard of me, right?

35:34.150 --> 35:35.630
Where is that girl now?

35:37.480 --> 35:39.140
You're here to save that girl.

35:39.760 --> 35:41.620
You're Xiao Qiushui, aren't you?

35:44.760 --> 35:47.840
So you're after Xiao Qiushui.

35:49.150 --> 35:50.480
It's not us who want him.

35:50.840 --> 35:52.590
The Power Gang wants him.

35:52.960 --> 35:55.820
Liu Suifeng from the Power Gang
has spread the word:

35:56.270 --> 35:58.270
whoever brings Xiao Qiushui to him

35:58.320 --> 35:59.920
will get a token in exchange.

36:00.230 --> 36:02.160
That token is extremely valuable.

36:02.880 --> 36:05.360
If the two of us want
to join the Power Gang,

36:05.800 --> 36:07.330
he wouldn't dare refuse us.

36:14.630 --> 36:18.030
So you want to side with Liu Suifeng

36:18.030 --> 36:19.360
and join the Power Gang?

36:20.960 --> 36:22.190
Liu Suifeng's offer

36:22.440 --> 36:23.800
is tempting.

36:24.190 --> 36:24.800
But

36:25.630 --> 36:27.480
we've already made contact
with the Sword King

36:27.480 --> 36:28.480
of the Power Gang.

36:28.670 --> 36:30.360
Although we haven't met in person,

36:30.360 --> 36:32.070
we can't switch sides so easily.

36:32.070 --> 36:33.070
We value loyalty.

36:33.110 --> 36:34.480
Right. Loyalty!

36:35.710 --> 36:37.350
If we hand over the person Liu Suifeng
has been looking for

36:37.350 --> 36:38.320
to the Sword King,

36:38.320 --> 36:39.920
the Sword King will surely be pleased.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.630
I was questioning him.

36:40.630 --> 36:41.920
Why did you spill everything?

36:41.920 --> 36:42.510
You fool.

36:42.920 --> 36:43.980
You started first.

36:44.920 --> 36:46.450
Are you Xiao Qiushui or not?

36:47.630 --> 36:49.110
Come on, get up and talk.

36:55.880 --> 36:57.880
I was a bit rough just now.

36:58.670 --> 36:59.880
I apologize for that.

37:01.510 --> 37:02.320
But

37:02.960 --> 37:03.960
you're mistaken.

37:04.320 --> 37:05.670
I'm not Xiao Qiushui.

37:06.280 --> 37:08.070
And we're supposed to believe that?

37:08.070 --> 37:09.190
What proof do you have?

37:09.190 --> 37:10.520
I've got a name of my own.

37:10.800 --> 37:12.030
I'm Xiao Donghuo.

37:15.710 --> 37:16.440
Wait.

37:28.960 --> 37:30.510
Xiao Donghuo?

37:30.980 --> 37:33.100
That name...

37:33.550 --> 37:34.950
Sounds familiar, right?

37:36.420 --> 37:38.350
I am indeed very familiar with him.

37:38.880 --> 37:40.680
He's a distant relative of mine.

37:40.880 --> 37:43.070
Only I and that girl you captured

37:43.460 --> 37:46.330
know where Xiao Qiushui is hiding.

37:47.800 --> 37:49.840
If she wasn't with Xiao Qiushui,

37:49.870 --> 37:51.270
why would she be with you?

37:51.630 --> 37:52.590
Truth is,

37:53.670 --> 37:55.530
the two of them had a falling-out.

37:56.150 --> 37:58.320
So she asked me

37:58.590 --> 38:00.590
to help teach Xiao Qiushui a lesson.

38:01.230 --> 38:02.190
Which means

38:02.190 --> 38:03.960
if you want to find Xiao Qiushui,

38:03.960 --> 38:05.230
you must ask her.

38:07.710 --> 38:09.640
But the word from the martial world

38:09.920 --> 38:12.590
is that Xiao Qiushui is
headed to Guangling

38:12.960 --> 38:14.560
with the Hero Command Token.

38:15.510 --> 38:17.110
We didn't catch Xiao Qiushui

38:17.440 --> 38:19.230
but got Xiao Donghuo?

38:25.880 --> 38:27.800
No. He's playing us.

38:29.280 --> 38:29.790
You…

38:29.840 --> 38:31.360
The Hero Command Token is priceless.

38:31.360 --> 38:33.000
If Xiao Qiushui knew

38:33.000 --> 38:35.020
the Power Gang was
pursuing him so relentlessly,

38:35.020 --> 38:37.940
he'd have hidden far away by now.

38:39.230 --> 38:41.070
You seem wise, sir.

38:41.550 --> 38:43.960
Why don't you tell me what you think?

38:45.670 --> 38:46.730
You have a good eye.

38:46.920 --> 38:48.800
I've poisoned that wine. Don't drink it.

38:48.800 --> 38:50.550
But you're right.

38:51.090 --> 38:53.090
That girl's no longer with us.

39:01.030 --> 39:03.070
If you don't start telling the truth,

39:03.070 --> 39:04.400
I'll have to beat you up.

39:04.710 --> 39:05.640
Hold on. Hold on.

39:05.760 --> 39:07.160
That won't be necessary.

39:07.400 --> 39:08.510
I'll just tell you.

39:09.000 --> 39:11.000
We've already handed that girl over

39:11.070 --> 39:13.670
to the person who connected us
with the Sword King—

39:13.670 --> 39:16.920
Zuo Changsheng,
the Burrow Demon of the Power Gang.

39:17.710 --> 39:20.310
He plans to present that girl
to the Sword King.

39:20.840 --> 39:21.920
Tell me the truth.

39:22.440 --> 39:23.590
It is the truth.

39:24.000 --> 39:25.330
If you don't believe me,

39:25.550 --> 39:26.880
stab me with that sword.

39:27.190 --> 39:28.390
Don't stab my friend!

39:29.440 --> 39:30.920
Tie, don't play the hero!

39:31.360 --> 39:32.670
Sir, stab me instead.

39:32.960 --> 39:33.590
Once you do,

39:33.590 --> 39:34.760
you'll know he's telling the truth.

39:34.760 --> 39:35.630
Let him stab me.

39:35.630 --> 39:36.230
Stab me!

39:36.400 --> 39:38.660
My buddy is weak. Don't stab him. Stab me.

39:38.710 --> 39:40.400
Alright, stop arguing.

39:41.280 --> 39:44.030
You've done something stupid.

39:44.800 --> 39:45.730
What do you mean?

39:47.710 --> 39:50.510
If the Burrow Demon learns from Tang Fang

39:50.510 --> 39:51.920
about Xiao Qiushui's whereabouts,

39:51.920 --> 39:53.440
he'll definitely bring Xiao Qiushui

39:53.440 --> 39:54.510
to the Sword King.

39:54.670 --> 39:55.840
If that happens,

39:55.960 --> 39:59.190
won't he steal all your credit?

40:02.480 --> 40:03.800
He's right.

40:04.150 --> 40:05.350
The urgent matter now

40:05.840 --> 40:07.710
is to find the Burrow Demon

40:07.960 --> 40:11.670
and then secretly get Tang Fang

40:12.140 --> 40:12.910
back.

40:14.070 --> 40:17.400
Qiu, he didn't stab either of us,

40:17.690 --> 40:19.420
and he's even giving us advice.

40:19.920 --> 40:21.180
I kind of like this guy.

40:21.480 --> 40:23.030
We could be friends with him.

40:23.030 --> 40:24.480
Since we're friends,

40:25.150 --> 40:27.110
and that girl is so important to him,

40:27.110 --> 40:28.710
we must help him get her back.

40:28.800 --> 40:29.440
Alright.

40:30.480 --> 40:31.960
Hey, Donghuo,

40:32.320 --> 40:34.000
we'll take care of it for you.

40:34.550 --> 40:35.750
We'll take you there.

40:52.590 --> 40:53.190
Master.

40:54.510 --> 40:55.640
I've received news.

40:56.000 --> 40:58.030
The Sword King's men have taken Tang Fang.

40:58.030 --> 41:00.440
What about Xiao Qiushui? Where is he?

41:01.070 --> 41:02.590
Guangling is
under the Sword King's control.

41:02.590 --> 41:04.110
Our spies have been rooted out by him.

41:04.110 --> 41:06.040
We haven't found Xiao Qiushui yet.

41:07.840 --> 41:09.640
But he'll definitely seek help.

41:10.280 --> 41:12.410
That would naturally mean Qu Hanshan,

41:12.710 --> 41:14.110
He Who Shakes Guangling,

41:14.550 --> 41:16.350
one of Guangling's Three Peaks.

41:16.800 --> 41:17.670
I've already sent people

41:17.670 --> 41:19.760
to investigate Tang Fang's situation.

41:19.760 --> 41:21.760
Tang Fang and the Hero Command Token

41:22.880 --> 41:25.480
must not slip through my fingers again.

41:25.920 --> 41:26.920
Understood.

41:29.590 --> 41:31.190
You don't allow anyone
to hurt Miss Tang Fang.

41:31.190 --> 41:32.850
That makes her your weakness.

41:35.110 --> 41:36.170
I spoke out of turn.

41:40.510 --> 41:41.370
Go do your work.

41:42.630 --> 41:43.190
Yes.
